{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "09601441-732f-84a9-ab4a-700847c4a1df",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:21:24-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisa Lopes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, this is Marisa Lopes. I'm calling about my water and sewer bill for my business. Basically, it's way higher than it should be."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can look into that. Has anything changed at the property recently?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, so, a new meter was installed last month. And basically the first bill since then looks totally off. Last year's winter bills were much lower, like not even close. Same office, same number of people, nothing different."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. A new meter can change how usage is read, and sometimes the first bill covers a period with both the old and new readings. Do you have the account number in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, yeah. Hang on. [pause] It's the one on the top right of the bill, right? Eight digits?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one. Go ahead and read it to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero four, four, one, seven, seven, two, nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:19:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Let me pull it up. [pause] I can see the meter exchange on the account, and the first reading on the new meter. I'm going to flag this for a meter reading review so someone can verify the usage figures."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Because honestly, I'm not paying that much for water when the only thing running here is a sink and a bathroom. Well, and the people across the hall are always cooking something fragrant, but that's not exactly my water bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I don't think their cooking is on your meter. [pause] I'll note that you're disputing the reading. The review can take a few days, and someone will contact you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Um, one more thing. If I do end up paying, is there a way to pay by phone after 4:30? I'm usually slammed until close and then City Hall is shut."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. You can pay online through the city's website at any hour, and there's also a drop box for payments outside regular hours. If you'd like to pay by phone, you'd need to call during business hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:20:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so online or the drop box. Got it. And if I pay, does that mess up the dispute?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:21:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It shouldn't. I'll put the dispute note on the account so it's on record. Is the number on the account the best one for the callback?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:21:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0151. That's the office line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:21:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0151. You'll hear from us once the review is done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:21:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks. I just want it fixed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:21:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
